OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rabbit returned to charity
OL,4,Afarm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rabbit has been returned to a charity
OL,7,Ffarm three days after being stolen.
OL,9,FOuseburn Farm, in Newcastle, said a man
OL,10,Fbroke into the site on Friday night and
OL,11,Fstole Kevin the giant lop from his
OL,12,Fhutch.
OL,14,FIt is the third time animals have been
OL,15,Fstolen from the inner city farm in two
OL,16,Fyears, which manager Katie Bates said
OL,17,Fwas "emotionally exhausting".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
