OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rabbit returned to charity
OL,4,Afarm
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut just hours after appealing for
OL,7,Finformation about Kevin's whereabouts
OL,8,Fon social media on Monday, Bates said
OL,9,Fthree young girls handed Kevin in at a
OL,10,Fneighbouring pub in a cardboard box.
